# Bugbot is reviewer-only

Bugbot may run as a free, read-only reviewer when Chupa asks or when CI has just gone green on a ready PR. It must not write code, push, apply labels, or merge.

Do not start paid Bugbot products or the Bugbot GitHub app billing flow.

After a clean Bugbot review, the authoring agent (not Bugbot) may add `review-passed`. Findings are fixed by the authoring agent, then reviewed again.
